#: notifications/templates/email_statuses.html:10
msgid ""
"Emails can be sent by Tabbycat for a variety of purposes. Emails are sent "
"when specific preferences are enabled (i.e. enabling Ballot Receipts) or "
"through actions available on specific pages (i.e. the Draw Display page for "
"matchups; or the Participants page for team registration). This page shows "
"the status of previously-sent emails."
